  "contentHtml": "<p>지구도둑 mbti를 활용한 기후행동 활동가 수업지도안입니다.</p><p>(중3 과학에 올린 동일내용. 총18페이지이고 미리보기 5페이지 사진 첨부합니다 ^^ )</p><p>&#160;</p><p>과학 + 사회과 지구온난화 및 국제문제 + 국어과 역할극</p><p>등과 융합수업이 가능합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>초,중등의 관련 성취기준이 있으므로 다른 학년에서 활용 가능합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c43943ac664d19f7264d8c2ef2eb6b28efeffc51?download\" data-file-name=\"중등-기후행동활동가.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2300608\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D957%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20211005084815&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc43943ac664d19f7264d8c2ef2eb6b28efeffc51')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">중등-기후행동활동가</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.19MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dc53f13616ce180c4b153fc951b4399e59f9fe66\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dc53f13616ce180c4b153fc951b4399e59f9fe66\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ac0d6fbb265daa8cdddace42177f579c3e239866\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ac0d6fbb265daa8cdddace42177f579c3e239866\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3eed16912a174d220d07d2c51a53b4d93ce954b0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" data-img-src=\"https://t1